    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLot number 2 of 8 lots. Being sold on the instructions of the Estate of the late Mr. Edmond Sweeny.\n\nDetached old farmhouse with outbuildings on 3.04 acres (1.23 hectares) set in a scenic rural location. Elevated views over Slahney River Valley and the surrounding mountains. The property contains some sections of mature native woodland which slope down to a stream.. \n\nThe farmhouse was built in the late 1800's . The house is in fair condition and requires refurbishment. (May qualify for vacant home refurbishment grant) https://www.gov.ie/en/publication/43d9d-refurbishing-vacant-property-all-supports/ Internal area of house over two storeys of about 95 sq.mt (1,023 sq. ft). GF: Kitchen, living room, sitting room, wc FF: 3 Bedrooms.. \n\nStone outbuilding of about 29.09 sq.mt (313 sq. ft) situated to the rear of the farmhouse.. \n\nPossibility of purchasing additional lands adjacent to the property (Lot 1 & Lot 3).\n\nHistory: The property is situated in close proximity to the site of the of the Battle of Callan fought on 24th July1261 and burial ground (MacCaura's Grave. ) of the local chieftain, Fineen MacCarthy.\n\nKilgarvan Village 4.3km. 14.0km Kenmare. 34km Bantry.. \n\nServices: Electricity (still connected). Public water supply. Sewerage by septic tank. No central heating. Wired for telephone. Wireless broadband service available in the area..\n\nDIRECTIONS:\nEircode: V93 W293: Leave Kenmare in the direction of Kilgarvan (R569). After 10km you will enter Kilgarvan Village. Turn right in the direction of Bantry. Continue for 2.8km and then take the junction to the right and continue for 1.2km and the entrance to the property will be on your left.\n\n**Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nNote 1 - \nMap and outlined aerial photos are for illustration purposes only.\n\nGround Floor - \n\n\nLivingroom - 4.30m x 4.30m\nView of surrounding countryside. Large open fireplace.\n\nSittingroom - 4.30m x 3.06m\nView of surrounding countryside. Open fireplace.\n\nKitchen - 2.90m x 1.82m\n\n\nWC - 1.40m x 0.90m\nWC\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.30m x 1.86m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.42m x 3.30m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.30m x 3.03m\n\n\nExterior - \n\n\nOutbuilding - 2.77m x 10.50m\nStone outbuilding with corrugated roof. 2.77m x 10.50m. Internal floor area of 29.09 sq.mt.\n\n"
      },
